=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121160/extras/7661bfd4c65e46231fa0f1ebf8314867.avif?t=1768175577\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, my dearest friend passed away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was an unexpected accident\u2014she must have still had so many things she wanted to do\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was asked to sort through her belongings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As I picked up each item and drifted into thought, memories of her came flooding back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good memories, bad memories\u2026 none of them mean anything anymore to someone who\u2019s no longer alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All I can do for her now is to carry those memories as I go on living.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2026But lately, something feels strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A restless feeling deep in my chest\u2014like she\u2019s still here, close by, even though she\u2019s supposed to be dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shadow moving in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something lurking in the silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hope it\u2019s all just my imagination\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But could she have resented me without my realizing it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I just want to keep the memories we shared\u2026 as good memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121160/extras/2baf243e96396cc87cf7030fa763a02c.poster.avif?t=1768175577\" width=300 height=536 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121160/extras/2baf243e96396cc87cf7030fa763a02c.webm?t=1768175577\" type=\"v